{"name":"Caoimhe","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"Elite Huntress","alignment":"neutral good","hitDice":"5","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":1,"otherArmorDesc":"16 Studded leather, hunter's poise","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"68 (16d8 − 16)","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"14","dexPoints":"18","conPoints":"8","intPoints":"11","wisPoints":"16","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"5","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Frost‑Hardened Survivor","desc":"[MON] has resistance to cold damage and has advantage on saving throws against being charmed or frightened."},{"name":"Expert Tracker","desc":"She has advantage on Wisdom (Survival) checks to track creatures, and while tracking she also learns their size, number, and travel pace."},{"name":"Dragonslayer","desc":"When [MON] hits a dragon or dragon‑type undead with a weapon attack, she deals an extra 7 (2d6) damage."},{"name":"Sneak Attack (1/Turn)","desc":"When Caoimhe hits a target with a weapon attack and has advantage on the attack roll, or when the target is within 5 feet of an ally of hers that isn’t incapacitated, she deals an extra [3d6] damage. This reflects a rogue‑like edge."},{"name":"Seasoned Ally","desc":"To keep PCs in the spotlight, only apply Sneak Attack or Dragonslayer, not both, unless the fight is meant to be very hard."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"Caoimhe makes three attacks with her longbow or shortswords in any combination."},{"name":"Longbow","desc":"Ranged Weapon Attack: [DEX ATK] to hit, range 150/600 ft., one target. Hit: [1d8 + 5] piercing damage, plus Sneak Attack or Dragonslayer if applicable."},{"name":"Shortsword","desc":"Melee Weapon Attack: [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: [1d6 + 5] piercing damage, plus Sneak Attack or Dragonslayer if applicable."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Hunter’s Step","desc":"Caoimhe takes the Dash or Disengage action"},{"name":"Hide","desc":"Caoimhe takes the Hide action if she has cover or is in dim light or darkness"}],"reactions":[{"name":"Guardian’s Shot","desc":"When a hostile creature that Caoimhe can see moves into melee with a PC within 30 feet of her, she can make one longbow attack against that creature"}],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"dex","order":1},{"name":"wis","order":4}],"skills":[{"name":"athletics","stat":"str","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"insight","stat":"wis","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"perception","stat":"wis","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"survival","stat":"wis","note":" (ex)"}],"damagetypes":[{"name":"cold","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}